# SEL goes round the effects: the walls, the tears, the copies, the dust, and back (pressed again, slowly:
# twice fast keeps a drawer open). Each page's knobs turn its own effect.
wait 300
tap SEL
expect page 5
shot 00_walls.png
wait 1000
tap SEL
expect page 4
shot 01_tears.png
wait 1000
tap SEL
expect page 14
spin K1 60
spin K3 40
tapkey 12
wait 300
expect par16 >60
shot 02_copies.png
wait 1000
tap SEL
expect page 15
spin K2 60
spin K3 50
tapkey 12
wait 400
expect par62 >40
shot 03_dust.png
wait 1000
tap SEL
expect page 5
# GLO: the one tempo, then the levels
tap GLO
expect page 8
spin K1 10
expect par25 94
shot 04_mixer.png
